{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, editorial-style Shopify section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference image as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not redesign, reinterpret, or change the layout. Reproduce the same two-column composition, image arrangement, typography, colours, spacing, proportions, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Background colour: warm ivory / pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired babywear aesthetic.
    
    Content maximum width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop section padding: 65px 55px.
    
    Two-column layout:
    
    Left content column: 46%.
    
    Right visual column: 54%.
    
    Vertically centre both columns.
    
    Use generous whitespace.
    
    Avoid unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – BRAND STORY
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    "— OUR STORY"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive green (#777D5D).
    
    Main heading:
    "For Every Kiss.
    For Every Cry."
    
    Font: Montserrat ExtraBold.
    
    Desktop font size: 40px.
    
    Line height: 1.05.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Preserve the two-line heading structure.
    
    First paragraph:
    
    "Kiss and Kry began with a simple belief: the very first things a baby wears should be the softest, kindest things they ever touch."
    
    Second paragraph:
    
    "So we chose bamboo, kept every design simple to dress and easy to love, and finished each piece with care. Considered essentials, made to bring a little more meaning to every day."
    
    Typography:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 12px.
    
    Line height: 1.65.
    
    Colour: soft grey olive (#858575).
    
    Paragraph spacing: 12px.
    
    Maximum width: 440px.
    
    Brand signature:
    
    "With love, Team Kiss and Kry"
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    12px.
    
    Dark olive.
    
    Below it:
    
    "Thoughtfully made. For every comfort."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    10px.
    
    Muted olive.
    
    3. BRAND VALUES – THREE PILL BADGES
    
    Under the brand signature, create three small horizontally aligned pill-shaped badges.
    
    Badge 1:
    
    Small circular icon: sparkle / star.
    
    Text: "Thoughtfully made"
    
    Badge 2:
    
    Small circular icon: leaf.
    
    Text: "Bamboo viscose"
    
    Badge 3:
    
    Small circular icon: heart.
    
    Text: "Everyday comfort"
    
    Design:
    
    Background: white / warm off-white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Thin subtle border.
    
    Small circular icon background in pale beige.
    
    Icon colour: muted olive.
    
    Text colour: dark olive.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium, 9px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 12px.
    
    Vertical padding: 7px.
    
    Gap: 8px.
    
    Keep all three badges on one line on desktop., 4. RIGHT COLUMN – IMAGE COLLAGE
    
    This is the most important visual element.
    
    Create an asymmetrical, overlapping three-element composition exactly like the reference.
    
    Image 1 – Top large image
    
    Position: upper-right.
    
    Landscape orientation.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 440px × 205px.
    
    Border radius: 18px.
    
    Show a close-up photograph of a happy baby wearing a mustard-yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby's face and upper body should be clearly visible.
    
    Natural, soft lighting.
    
    Warm neutral background.
    
    Object-fit: cover.
    
    Image 2 – Bottom-left overlapping image
    
    Position: below the first image, slightly towards the left.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 245px × 225px.
    
    Square-ish portrait crop.
    
    Border radius: 12px.
    
    Overlap the lower-left portion of the top image.
    
    Show a baby wearing a soft yellow bamboo outfit, lying comfortably on a fluffy cream blanket.
    
    Natural lifestyle photography.
    
    Warm, soft, premium appearance.
    
    Add a clean white border of approximately 5px around the image.
    
    Image 3 – Bottom-right brand quote card
    
    Position: bottom-right, beside the smaller baby image.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 250px × 150px.
    
    Background: dark olive green (#626B4C).
    
    Border radius: 16px.
    
    Padding: 24px.
    
    Align text to the left.
    
    Quote card content:
    
    Large decorative quotation mark:
    "“"
    
    Quote:
    "As gentle as a first kiss. As comforting as a hug after every cry."
    
    Attribution:
    "THE KISS AND KRY PROMISE"
    
    Styling:
    
    Quotation mark: mustard yellow (#E7B13A), 30px, bold.
    
    Quote: warm ivory (#F5F3E7), Montserrat SemiBold, 15px.
    
    Line height: 1.4.
    
    Attribution: Montserrat Medium, 8px.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted cream.
    
    5. EXACT POSITIONING
    
    Desktop composition must follow this structure:
    
    LEFT:
    
    Eyebrow.
    
    Main two-line heading.
    
    Two paragraphs.
    
    Brand signature.
    
    Three value pills.
    
    RIGHT:
    
    Large landscape baby image at the top.
    
    Smaller square baby image overlapping beneath it on the left.
    
    Dark olive quote card positioned beneath it on the right.
    
    The three visual elements must form a balanced asymmetrical collage.
    
    Do not arrange the images in a regular grid.
    Do not place the quote card above or below both images.
    Do not remove the overlapping image effect.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background: #F5F3E7;
    color: #626B4C;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before,
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 65px 55px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 46% 54%; align-items: center; gap: 0;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy { max-width: 440px; padding-right: 28px; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 17px; color: #777D5D;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1.4; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    max-width: 440px; margin: 0 0 19px; color: #626B4C;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph {
    max-width: 440px; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #747568;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature { margin-top: 19px; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff {
    margin: 0 0 4px; color: #626B4C;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline {
    margin: 0; color: #777D5D;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge {
    min-height: 31px; display: inline-flex; flex: 0 0 auto; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e2d5; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; color: #626B4C;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-wrap {
    width: 18px; height: 18px; display: inline-flex; flex: 0 0 18px; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%; background: #f2efe2; color: #626B4C;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-wrap svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; display: block; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; min-height: 390px; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo {
    position: absolute; display: block; object-fit: cover; width: 77%; height: 205px; top: 0; right: 0;
    border-radius: 18px; object-position: center;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-placeholder {
    position: absolute; display: block; width: 77%; height: 205px; top: 0; right: 0;
    overflow: hidden; border-radius: 18px; background: #ebe8dc;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; color: #c6c2b2; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small {
    position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: 0; top: 165px; display: block; width: 43%; height: 225px;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: center; border: 5px solid #fff; border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder {
    position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: 0; top: 165px; width: 43%; height: 225px;
    overflow: hidden; border: 5px solid #fff; border-radius: 12px; background: #ebe8dc;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; color: #c6c2b2; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote {
    position: absolute; right: 0; top: 240px; z-index: 1; width: 44%; min-height: 150px;
    padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 16px; background: #626B4C; color: #F5F3E7;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-mark { margin: 0 0 1px; color: #E7B13A; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; line-height: .9; }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text {
    margin: 0 0 9px; color: #F5F3E7;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__attribution {
    margin: 0; color: #e8e4d7;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 8px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty {
    position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; left: 10px; z-index: 3; color: #626B4C;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 10px; text-align: center;
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { padding: 48px 32px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy { padding-right: 18px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual { padding-left: 8px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage { min-height: 340px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo, .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-placeholder { height: 175px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small, .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder { top: 142px; height: 195px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote { top: 205px; min-height: 132px; padding: 13px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text { font-size: 13px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { padding: 42px 24px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy { max-width: 100%; padding-right: 0; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size: 34px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual { padding-left: 0; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage { max-width: 600px; min-height: 340px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo, .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-placeholder { width: 78%; height: 175px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small, .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder { top: 142px; width: 44%; height: 190px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote { top: 208px; width: 48%; min-height: 126px; padding: 12px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text { font-size: 12px; }
    .ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__attribution { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<section class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy">
      <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
      <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph">{{ block.settings.paragraph_one | escape }}</p>
      <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__paragraph">{{ block.settings.paragraph_two | escape }}</p>
      <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signature">
        <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__signoff">{{ block.settings.signature | escape }}</p>
        <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline">{{ block.settings.tagline | escape }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badges" aria-label="Brand values">
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge"><span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="m8 1 1.2 4.1L13 7l-3.8 1.3L8 12l-1.2-3.7L3 7l3.8-1.9L8 1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m13 10 .6 1.6L15 12l-1.4.5L13 14l-.5-1.5L11 12l1.5-.4L13 10Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>{{ block.settings.badge_one | escape }}</span>
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge"><span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M13.7 2.3C7.2 2.1 3 4.2 3 8.1c0 2.1 1.6 3.5 3.6 3.5 4.1 0 6.9-4.2 7.1-9.3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M2.4 14c1.8-3.6 4.6-5.8 8-7.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>{{ block.settings.badge_two | escape }}</span>
        <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge"><span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 13.4 2.7 8.3A3.1 3.1 0 0 1 7.1 4L8 5l.9-1a3.1 3.1 0 0 1 4.4 4.3L8 13.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>{{ block.settings.badge_three | escape }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual">
      <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collage">
        {% if block.settings.story_image != blank %}
          <img class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo" src="{{ block.settings.story_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.story_image.alt | default: 'Baby wearing a mustard yellow bamboo outfit' | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.story_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.story_image.height }}">
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-placeholder">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add the large babywear image</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.detail_image != blank %}
          <img class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo-small" src="{{ block.settings.detail_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.detail_image.alt | default: 'Baby in yellow bamboo clothing on a cream blanket' | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.detail_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.detail_image.height }}">
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__small-placeholder">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <span class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add the overlapping lifestyle image</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote">
          <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</p>
          <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote-text">{{ block.settings.quote | escape }}</p>
          <p class="ai-story-{{ ai_gen_id }}__attribution">{{ block.settings.attribution | escape }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Editorial brand story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_image", "label": "Large baby image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "detail_image", "label": "Overlapping baby image" },
    { "type": "font_picker", "id": "heading_font", "label": "Heading font", "default": "montserrat_n7" },
    { "type": "font_picker", "id": "body_font", "label": "Body font", "default": "montserrat_n4" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Brand story" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "— OUR STORY" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "For Every Kiss.\nFor Every Cry." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "paragraph_one", "label": "First paragraph", "default": "Kiss and Kry began with a simple belief: the very first things a baby wears should be the softest, kindest things they ever touch." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "paragraph_two", "label": "Second paragraph", "default": "So we chose bamboo, kept every design simple to dress and easy to love, and finished each piece with care. Considered essentials, made to bring a little more meaning to every day." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signature", "label": "Signature", "default": "With love, Team Kiss and Kry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline", "default": "Thoughtfully made. For every comfort." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Brand values" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_one", "label": "First badge", "default": "Thoughtfully made" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_two", "label": "Second badge", "default": "Bamboo viscose" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "badge_three", "label": "Third badge", "default": "Everyday comfort" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Quote card" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "quote", "label": "Quote", "default": "As gentle as a first kiss. As comforting as a hug after every cry." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "attribution", "label": "Attribution", "default": "THE KISS AND KRY PROMISE" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Editorial brand story" }
  ],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "editorial-brand-story"
}
{% endschema %}